{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# webcache — Server-Side Render\n`client.render(url, max_age=…)` → `GET /render` — uses cache lookup + browserless + request auth",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 90
    },
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**START**\nScraper needs fully-rendered HTML for a URL",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[Scraper]**\nCalls `client.render(url, bucket=\"default\", max_age=7200)`",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 70
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[WebCacheClient]**\n`GET /render?url=…&bucket=…&max_age=…` (timeout: 120 s)",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 70
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[webcache service → PostgreSQL]**\nLooks up URL in cache; compares `stored_at` against `max_age`",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 310,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 80
    },
    {
      "id": "decision",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Cache hit and still fresh?",
      "x": 160,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "hit",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**YES — cache hit**\nReturn stored content + metadata immediately\n(no outbound request made)",
      "x": -260,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "miss-s1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**NO — miss or stale**\n**[webcache service → request-auth-server]**\nAcquire permit: `permit = ra_client.acquire(domain)` via gRPC bidi stream\n— blocks until server grants",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "miss-s2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[webcache service → browserless]**\nPOST puppeteer script to render the URL\nReceives: rendered HTML, cookies, response metadata",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 710,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "miss-s3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[webcache service]**\nWrites rendered HTML to local file storage\nInserts cache entry into PostgreSQL",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "miss-s4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[webcache service → request-auth-server]**\n`permit.release(status_code)` via gRPC stream\nServer applies backoff, releases pool slot",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "merge",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[webcache service]**\nReturns rendered content, cookies, response_metadata,\nand all standard cache entry fields",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1130,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 80
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**END**\n`client.render()` returns the dict (or `None` on 404) to the Scraper",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e-title-start",
      "fromNode": "title",
      "toNode": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-start-s1",
      "fromNode": "start",
      "toNode": "s1"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-s1-s2",
      "fromNode": "s1",
      "toNode": "s2",
      "label": "REST/HTTP"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-s2-s3",
      "fromNode": "s2",
      "toNode": "s3",
      "label": "SQL"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-s3-dec",
      "fromNode": "s3",
      "toNode": "decision"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-dec-hit",
      "fromNode": "decision",
      "toNode": "hit",
      "label": "fresh cache hit"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-dec-miss",
      "fromNode": "decision",
      "toNode": "miss-s1",
      "label": "miss or stale"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-miss-s1-s2",
      "fromNode": "miss-s1",
      "toNode": "miss-s2",
      "label": "gRPC bidi stream — permit granted"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-miss-s2-s3",
      "fromNode": "miss-s2",
      "toNode": "miss-s3",
      "label": "REST/HTTP"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-miss-s3-s4",
      "fromNode": "miss-s3",
      "toNode": "miss-s4",
      "label": "SQL"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-hit-merge",
      "fromNode": "hit",
      "toNode": "merge"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-miss-s4-merge",
      "fromNode": "miss-s4",
      "toNode": "merge",
      "label": "gRPC bidi stream — permit released"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-merge-end",
      "fromNode": "merge",
      "toNode": "end"
    }
  ]
}
